  "fullDescription": "Summer garden, watercolor flowers, hand drawing floral illustrations perfectly for printable, sublimation.\n\nBright hand painted watercolor flowers clipart for wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 63 items:\n– 29 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 3000 px x 2000 px / 10 in x 6,7 in);\n– 9 compositions in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 4000 px x 6000 px / 13,3 in x 20 in);\n– 5 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (size 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 6 seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 6 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white and colored background (different sizes 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in and 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 8 floral frames for greeting cards in PNG files with transparent background and 8 backgrounds in JPEG files with white background (size letter 2400 px x 3300 px / 8 in x 11 in).\n\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
